    "about": {"x": 1410, "y": 1928, "w": 390, "fill": "orange", "size": "m", "text": "Design direction: cinematic streaming look, kept on the Flixvault orange.\n\n• Deeper black background, bigger posters, content in rows like streaming apps.\n• Space Grotesk headings + Inter text.\n• Same 5 tabs (Cloud, Feed, Explore, Channels, Profile), Explore in the centre.\n• Same rules: ads users see previews, organic users go to plans, UPI payments unchanged.\n\nPictures are samples. Your real posters and thumbnails show in their place.\n\nComment on any screen to change it. Approve and I'll build it in the app."}
